DESCRIPTION:Each month we pick two jazz records: one well known and anothe
 r that is lesser known\nWhen we gather we'll talk about the records we lis
 tened to in a variety of ways. One person might share a poem or painting t
 hey wrote while listening. Another person might share some research they d
 id on the players. Another person might really like "track three" and shar
 e their thoughts on why that is. Then at the end of the meeting\, we'll as
 sign two more records.\nSound like fun? Join us!\nOn September 26th the gr
 oup will discuss:\nFirst Light / Freddie Hubbard\nNative Dancer / Wayne Sh
 orter\nEvent by Ulysses Philomathic Library\n\nSource: FLXcalendar - https
 ://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/78464192/20260913153000
STATUS:CONFIRMED
