DESCRIPTION:Event by Tompkins Chamber\nTrumansburg Golf Club\n23 Halsey St
 \, Trumansburg\, NY 14886-9531\, United States\nPublic\nJoin us for one of
  the most anticipated events of the year—the Annual Tompkins Chamber Gol
 f Tournament! Whether you're a seasoned golfer or just looking for a fun d
 ay out on the green\, this event is the perfect opportunity to network\, u
 nwind\, and support the Tompkins Chamber.\nHeld in a Captain's Crew / Best
  Ball format\, the tournament is ideal for players of all skill levels. Re
 gistration fee includes lunch\, snacks\, beverages\, and a mouth-watering 
 chicken BBQ dinner.\nWhy Attend?\nBeyond the golf\, food\, and prizes\, th
 is tournament is a chance to:\n-Make meaningful connections with local bus
 iness leaders\n-Promote your business in a relaxed\, fun setting\n-Support
  the Chamber’s mission to grow a vibrant\, inclusive community\nSpots fi
 ll up fast\, so don’t miss your chance to be part of this signature summ
 er event. Grab your clubs and join us for a day of fun\, community\, and p
 urpose!\nRegister now and let’s hit the fairway together!\nhttps://busin
 ess.tompkinschamber.org/.../annual-chamber...\nThis year's tournament will
  be held at Trumansburg Golf Club and is presented by Coughlin & Gerhart\,
  LLP with support from Centralus Health\, The Canopy\, Hilton Garden Inn\,
  Trade Design Build\, and Bowers Accountants & Advisors (Previously Sciara
 bba Walker & Co.)\n\nSource: FLXcalendar - https://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uz
 pj/event/78440389/20260915083000
STATUS:CONFIRMED
URL:https://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/78440389/20260915083000
