CATEGORIES:Boats,Nature
DESCRIPTION:Event by Friends of the Chemung River Watershed\, Inc.\nGrove 
 Street Boat Launch\nPublic\nNew in 2026! We're expanding our paddle progra
 m and adding monthly evening paddles! Join expert paddler Jim Pfiffer and 
 our Volunteer River Guides on the Chemung River for a short and sweet guid
 ed paddle. We'll enjoy a unique experience on the river with a relaxing pa
 ddle from Fitch's Bridge Boat Launch to Grove Street Boat Launch in Elmira
 \, NY.\nMeet us at Grove Street Boat Launch at 5pm to leave your vehicles
 \, then we'll shuttle all paddlers to Fitch's Bridge to go over river safe
 ty guidelines and launch our watercraft by 5:30pm. See detailed rental ins
 tructions below.\nPlease dress for the weather and bring/wear water shoes
 \, a hat\, sunscreen\, a re-usable water bottle\, a change of clothes is r
 ecommended\, and a life jacket if you have one. LIFE JACKETS ARE REQUIRED
 \; we will have life jackets available if you don't have one. Snacks are a
 lso recommended!\nThe FCRW Kayak Rental price includes the guided river to
 ur and a kayak rental. If you need one\, we have a limited number of kayak
 s available. We will meet at Grove Street Boat Launch at 5pm. Paddlers wil
 l leave their vehicles at Grove Street. FCRW will shuttle paddlers to Fitc
 h's Bridge for a safety talk and then launch our watercraft by 5:30pm.\nTh
 e BYOK (Bring your own kayak) price includes the guided river tour. Paddle
 rs bringing their own craft will drop them off at the start of the paddle 
 at Fitch's Bridge Boat Launch between 4-4:45pm where an FRCW Staff will wa
 tch over them\, then travel to Grove Street Boat Launch to meet Cait and t
 he rest of the paddlers at 5pm. Paddlers will leave their vehicles at Grov
 e Street. FCRW will shuttle paddlers to Fitch's Bridge for a safety talk a
 nd then launch our watercraft by 5:30pm.\nFitch's Bridge Boat Launch - Off
  Hendy Hollow Road\, Elmira\, NY 14905\nGrove Street Boat Launch - 36 Grov
 e St\, Elmira\, NY 14905\nTickets: https://www.eventbrite.com/e/guided-eve
 ning-paddle-fitchs-bridge-to-grove-street-boat-launch-tickets-198881335829
