BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:FLX Ride for Life\, Ithaca
DTSTART:20260919T110000Z
DTEND:20260920T035959Z
DTSTAMP:20260914T155238Z
UID:ce41b398f163a6e45ea25630a0bff4ce003e9e29@corning-events
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Causes,Bikes
DESCRIPTION:Finger Lakes Ride for Life – Ride. Fundraise. Make an Impact
 .\nJoin us on September 19\, 2026 for a powerful day of community\, connec
 tion\, and purpose.\nThe Finger Lakes Ride for Life is more than just a bi
 ke ride—it’s a century cycling event with route options ranging from 1
 4 to 100 miles\, designed for riders of all levels. Whether you’re brand
  new to cycling or chasing a personal best\, there’s a place for you on 
 the road.\nThis is a fundraiser that directly supports the life-changing w
 ork of the Southern Tier AIDS Program (STAP) right here in our communities
 .\nSTAP provides:\n• HIV & STI testing and prevention\n• Harm reductio
 n services\n• Case management & housing support\n• Food Pantry\n• LG
 BTQ+ youth support and affirming services\n• Education\, outreach\, and 
 so much more\nEvery dollar raised helps ensure these services remain acces
 sible\, compassionate\, and stigma-free.\nAnd this year\, we’re making i
 t easier than ever to get involved…\nRegistration is FREE.\nNot sure if 
 you can make it on the 19th?\nHave a wedding that weekend?\nStill working 
 your way up to those miles?\nNo problem. Seriously!!\nWhen you register\, 
 you’ll get your own personal fundraising page—so you can start making 
 an impact right away by sharing STAP’s mission and story with your frien
 ds and family.\nOn ride day\, you can expect:\n14–100 mile route options
  for all abilities\n7 fully supported pit stops with snacks\, refreshments
 \, and bathrooms\nFull safety and gear support along the routes\nBeautiful
  Finger Lakes scenery\nLunch\, dinner\, and plenty of fuel to keep you goi
 ng\nAnd the most powerful part of all—the camaraderie\nThere’s nothing
  like riding alongside friends\, family\, and neighbors\, united for a cau
 se that truly matters.\nWhether you’re riding\, volunteering at a pit st
 op\, cheering from the sidelines\, or supporting a rider\, you’re part o
 f something truly special in our community. Every mile matters. Every ride
 r counts. And every dollar raised strengthens vital local health and human
  service programs.\nRegister today. Start fundraising and be part of somet
 hing truly special in our community.\nhttps://p2p.onecause.com/arfl\nOR\nf
 lxride.org\n\nSource: FLXcalendar - https://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/even
 t/78464206/20260919070000
STATUS:CONFIRMED
URL:https://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/78464206/20260919070000
END:VEVENT
