DESCRIPTION:Join us for our Author & Craft Festival on Saturday\, Septembe
 r 19\, 2026\, from 12:00 to 3:00 PM at the Dundee Library. This community 
 event will showcase talented local authors and creative craft vendors from
  around the region. Browse unique handmade items\, meet authors\, discover
  new books\, and support local artists and makers all in one place.\nGuest
 s will also enjoy live music by local musician Randy Knapp throughout the 
 afternoon\, creating a fun and welcoming atmosphere for visitors of all ag
 es.\nWhether you are searching for your next great read\, shopping for one
 -of-a-kind handmade goods\, or simply looking for a relaxing afternoon in 
 the community\, there will be something for everyone to enjoy. Admission i
 s free and open to the public.\nLocal authors and craft vendors are invite
 d to participate. Applications are available online or at the library. Com
 pleted applications may be returned by email to dundee@stls.org or mailed/
