DESCRIPTION:One of the premier Willow Running events is in Montour Falls (
 Watkins Glen)\, NY. There will be various race distance on the beautiful C
 atharine Valley Trail to choose from including the 18M\, a great training 
 run for those gearing up for a fall marathon\, Half Marathon\, 10K & 5 K d
 istances. The trail is an old Rail Trail that is well maintained all year 
 and easy to navigate with a slight elevation gain heading out and a slight
  elevation decline heading back to the finish line.\nPost race enjoy a fun
  filled celebration with music\, food and drinks.\nThis years event will o
 nce again benefit the Friends of the Catharine Valley Trail\nCome enjoy th
 e Finger Lakes Region of New York State\, take in the fall foliage\, enjoy
  the many wineries and craft beer locations that dominate the region.\nCli
 ck here for full details and to sign up\n\nSource: FLXcalendar - https://c
 alendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/78464198/20260925000000
STATUS:CONFIRMED
URL:https://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/78464198/20260925000000
