DESCRIPTION:Join us in celebrating the 100th birthday of the iconic True L
 ove Schooner during a special two-day waterfront event on Friday and Satur
 day\, September 25 and 26\, in Watkins Glen's Seneca Harbor Park. This com
 munity celebration will honor a century of history\, craftsmanship\, and s
 ailing tradition with a full schedule of activities for all ages. Festivit
 ies begin at 5pm on Friday and resume at 10am on Saturday.\nOn Friday\, en
 joy an up-close look at a dozen classic sailboats\, breathe in the earthy 
 sweetness of Seneca Lake during Lucky Hare Brewing’s Happy Hour\, and si
 ng along with Uncle Joe and Renee\, who will be playing sea chanties. Part
 icipation is optional\, but highly recommended! Friday will wind down with
  a free\, outdoor showing of High Society at 7pm in the Seneca Harbor Park
 .\nSaturday\, September 26th activities:\n10AM – Opening Ceremonies: Ble
 ssing of the Fleet\, family activities\, knot-tying demos\, and vendor boo
 ths.\n12PM – Maritime Walking Tour: Explore the deep history of Seneca L
 ake and of course\, the Schooner True Love!\n1PM – Classic Sailboat Rega
 tta: Watch the race on the water!\n3PM – Panel Discussion: Heartfelt sto
 ries from former True Love owners.\n4PM – Walking Tour & Barrel Pull: An
 other tour plus a barrel pull with Lucky Hare Brewing!\n5PM – 8PM – Li
 ve Music & Raffles: The perfect end to the day!\nCome celebrate the enduri
 ng legacy of the True Love and enjoy a memorable weekend on the waterfront
 ! For more information visit the True Love Sail-a-bration website here: ht
 tps://watkinsglen.com/true-love-sailabration/\n\nSource: FLXcalendar - htt
 ps://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/78464205/20260925153000
STATUS:CONFIRMED
URL:https://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/78464205/20260925153000
END:VEVENT
