BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Rooted Together - A Child Loss Support Group - CareFirstNY
DTSTART:20261020T220000Z
DTEND:20261020T233000Z
DTSTAMP:20260914T155238Z
UID:175fcf48e118ba3c3e94aae0546449a99df8a09f@corning-events
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Support,Community
DESCRIPTION:FREE to attend | Registration is encouraged\, but not required
 :\nhttps://carefirstny-bloom.kindful.com/e/rooted-together-9-15\n- - - - -
 \nCareFirstNY is proud to offer Rooted Together: A Child Loss Support Grou
 p\, a welcoming space for parents and caregivers in the Southern Tier who 
 are grieving the loss of a child of any age\, due to illness or unexpected
  accident.\nThis support group will meet in-person on the 3rd Tuesday of e
 very month at our facility in Painted Post.\nLed by licensed clinicians\, 
 each session offers strategies\, activities\, and guidance to help partici
 pants navigate the challenges of grief and find support within the communi
 ty.\nSession Facilitators:\n- Heather Morey\, LCSW\, CCTP\, CTMH\nCareFirs
 tNY Clinical Therapist & Coordinator\n- Ric Miller\, LMSW\, CGP\, CCTP\nCa
 reFirstNY Grief Support Coordinator\nRooted Together is designed as a drop
 -in group—participants are welcome to attend whenever they feel the need
  for support\, without any commitment to a set number of sessions. Each ga
 thering offers space for reflection\, healing\, and connection\, meeting f
 amilies wherever they are in their grief journey.\n- - - - -\nHave questio
 ns or are unsure what to expect?\nContact our clinic team at (607) 962-310
 0 or email info@CareFirstNY.org for more information.\n\nSource: FLXcalend
 ar - https://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/78462637/20260915180000
STATUS:CONFIRMED
URL:https://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/78462637/20260915180000
END:VEVENT
