  all ages…with pumpkins!\nJack’s got a field of pumpkins to grow but w
 ould rather laze around singing songs. Lucky for him\, the Devil shows up 
 to steal his soul! Will the Devil get him\, or can Jack trick the Devil in
 to doing his work? See the story unfold with puppets\, life-sized masked c
 haracters\, original songs\, and a spooktacular finale! Join the fun and b
 ring your own Jack-o-Lantern to see it in the show!\nPumpkins\, tricks and
